+
+The caller owns its browser and supplies the original input API. Read-only app
+probes never assign saves, coordinates, cap phases, clocks or drawing routines.
+An optional local old-site comparison belongs to the standalone study only;
+normal release checks use the current args.url and strict args.version.
+"""
+import base64, hashlib, json, re, time
+from pathlib import Path
